+      "note": "Context values that are recorded carry a status; failed counting stores null and unavailable, and successful pre-call counts are labeled estimated. Optional cache counters default to zero, but an absent overall context count does not. The omitted classifier context is addressed under R07.1."
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "R07.3",
+      "result": "holds",
