+      "note": "The eligibility sub-agent handoff forwards traceparent but no context size; the peer API options and request body also omit it. The workflow preserves a local copy in its own audit record, which does not carry the value across the peer handoff. Additionally, the successful executor audit record stores context and identity but only clinicId as detail; the actual result is emitted separately by ctx.log.info at line 87 without context or traceparent."
+    }
+  ],
+  "note": "The main tool path records labeled decision context, but classifier decisions omit it and the eligibility peer handoff does not carry it."
